ekonferenz wie ein Zufall, der Geschichte schrieb. Für viele Zeitzeugen bleibt jene Nacht bis heute die emotionalste Erinnerung ihres Lebens.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Zeitungsartikel: Als die Mauer fiel","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Doris, verstehst du eigentlich, wie plötzlich die Wende damals kam?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_028_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ja, 1961 wurde Deutschland geteilt, und 1989 fiel die Mauer — fast niemand hatte das erwartet.","speaker":"Doris","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_028_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und heute, dreißig Jahre später, ist vieles noch spürbar.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_028_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Genau, meine Oma erinnert sich noch an jeden Moment davon.","speaker":"Doris","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_028_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Doris, verstehst du eigentlich, wie plötzlich die Wende damals kam?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_028_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-28-tempuswechsel-im-text","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ja, 1961 wurde Deutschland geteilt, und 1989 fiel die Mauer